- [builder:claude-b] Import reads the "Quicken" or "QuickBooks" file most banks and card sites offer (OFX, QFX, QBO) on the phone: no columns to check, the account picked for you (shown by its last 4 digits, never kept), the same file twice adds nothing, the gap warning works as for a CSV, and one tap also sets the balance to the bank's own figure. Bank connections no longer mention Plaid.
